      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "After we prepared everything, including the schedule, reliable weather forecast and the insurance, we began our trip. Our journey was along a river flowing from a high altitude. Our pace was slow because the river frequently had many sharp bends through deep valleys, where the water seemed to boil.",
        "zh": "准备好一切之后，包括行程表，可靠的天气预报和保险，我们踏上了旅程。我们沿着一条从高海拔地区流下来的河流前进。行进的速度很慢，因为河道常常急转弯，穿过深深的山谷，那里的水仿佛在沸腾。",
        "start": 76.91333333333333,
        "voiceEnd": 100.99333333333333,
